TypeScript Directed Graph
A training document for the DSA Mentor RAG collection. It teaches the directed graph in TypeScript with a
typed DiGraph class (adjacency list): construction without shared arrays, one-way edges, cycle detection
with three states, topological sort, BFS shortest hops and Kosaraju strongly connected components.
JavaScript and Mnemonist have no graph class, so it is written here.
