A training document for the DSA Mentor RAG collection. It teaches the double-ended queue in TypeScript
with a generic Deque using integer indexes: pushFront and pushBack, empty handling, typed peeks,
rotation, the sliding window maximum and 0-1 BFS. Mnemonist (npm) provides FixedDeque.
